  0004          132: WRITEB:BUFFERP  EQU     SCBLK:WRBUF     BUFFER POINTER
  0006          133: WRITEB:COUNT    EQU     SCBLK:WRLEN     BYTE COUNTER
  0008          134: WRITEB:SCLEN    EQU     SCBLK:RPLEN     WRITEB SYSCALL BLOCK LENGTH
                135: *
  0002          136: CONTROL:CHANNEL EQU     SCBLK:PARAMS    CHANNEL NUMBER
  0003          137: CONTROL:CODE    EQU     SCBLK:PARAMS+1  CONTROL CODE
  0004          138: CONTROL:SCLEN   EQU     SCBLK:WRBUF     CONTROL SYSCALL BLOCK MINIMUM LENGTH
  0000          139: CONTROL:DATA    EQU     0       DISPLACEMENT INTO WRITE BUFFER FOR CONTROL DATA
                140: *
  0002          141: STATUS:CHANNEL  EQU     SCBLK:PARAMS    CHANNEL NUMBER
  0003          142: STATUS:CODE     EQU     SCBLK:PARAMS+1  STATUS SELECTOR CODE
  000A          143: STATUS:BUFFERP  EQU     SCBLK:RDBUF     POINTER TO STATUS TARGET BUFFER
  000C          144: STATUS:MAXCOUNT EQU     SCBLK:RDLEN     SIZE OF STATUS READ-BACK BUFFER
  0008          145: STATUS:ACTUALCOUNT      EQU     SCBLK:RPLEN     ACTUAL # STATUS BYTES READ
  000E          146: STATUS:SCLEN    EQU     SCBLK:DATA      STATUS SYSCALL BLOCK MINIMUM LENGTH
  0000          147: STATUS:DATA     EQU     0       DISPLACEMENT INTO READ BUFFER FOR READ-BACK STATUS
                148: *
  0002          149: WAITDONE:CHANNEL        EQU     SCBLK:PARAMS    CHANNEL NUMBER
