                151: *
  0002          152: EXIT:SCLEN      EQU     SCBLK:PARAMS    EXIT SYSCALL BLOCK LENGTH
                153: *
  0002          154: ERROREXIT:CODE  EQU     SCBLK:PARAMS    ERROR CODE NUMBER
