                156: *
  0002          157: SETERROR:CODE   EQU     SCBLK:PARAMS    ERROR CODE NUMBER
  0004          158: SETERROR:SCLEN  EQU     SCBLK:WRBUF     SETERROR SYSCALL BLOCK LENGTH
                159: *
  000A          160: GETERROR:BUFFERP        EQU     SCBLK:RDBUF     POINTER TO ERROR READ-BACK AREA
  000C          161: GETERROR:MAXCOUNT       EQU     SCBLK:RDLEN     SHOULD BE 2




