                 10: *                  BASIC RUNTIME PACKAGE
                 11: *                  COPYRIGHT (C) 1977 SOFTWARE DYNAMICS
                 12: *                  ALL RIGHTS RESERVED
                 13: *                  7/9/79  CHANGE BCD FLOATING POINT TO BASE 100 BINARY DIGIT FLOATING POINT -- I.B.
                 14: *                  7/11/79 REMOVE VALUE STACK OVERFLOW CHECKS ON "LOAD" OPCODES
                 15: *                          (SPEEDS THINGS UP, ALMOST NEVER FAILS ANYWAY)
                 16: *                  7/13/79 INSTALL FIX16; SPEED UP "OPSTORE"
                 17: *                  9/4/79 GET RID OF IO-PACKAGE JUMP TABLE, INSTALL SYSCALLS ***
                 18: *                  9/22/79 I.B. OPTIMIZE VECTOR/SCALAR LOAD/STORES SIZE/SPEED
                 19: *                          ALLOW SUBROUTINE PARAMETERS
                 20: *                          ADD OPCODES LEN(VECTOR), ROWS(ARRAY), COLS(ARRAY)
                 21: *                          TRAP ON INPUT CONVERSION ON CHANNEL 0 IS ERROR TRAPPING ENABLED
                 22: *                          SD'S HAVE NON-ZERO MSB TO SIDESTEP SPEED OPTIMIZATION ON SCALAR FETCH
                 23: *                          INSTALL EXTENDED OPCODE HANDLER; MODIFY SOME OPCODES TO MATCH
                 24: *                  9/31/79 I.B. CLEANUP FOR 9/22 PASS
                 25: *                          ALLOW INDEPENDENTLY COMPILED SUBROUTINES/FUNCTIONS
                 26: *                          CHANGE ERROR HANDLING SO EACH MAIN/SUBR/FN HAS OWN ERROR TRAP
                 27: *                          MERGED GOSUBSTACK INTO MACHINE STACK
                 28: *                          OPTIMIZED FOR-NEXT, ALLOW ZERO LOOP ITERATIONS, SLIGHT SPEEDUP
                 29: *                  10/4/79 I.B. CLEANUP AGAIN... ALSO ADD STRING ARRAY HANDLING
                 30: *                  3/3/80  I.B. MAKE PATCHES TO 10/4/79 VERSION PERMANENT
                 31: *                  7/8/80  1.4g            I.B. MORE CLEANUP; INSTALL ERROR <exp>, CHR$(exp),
                 32: *                                          Error propogation from inside fns, PSHDs
                 33: *                  12/8/80 1.4h            I.B. FIX ERRORS UNCOVERED BY DIAGNOSTICS.
                 34: *                                          CONVERT TO M680C AND TEST ON 6800.
                 35: *                                          SPEEDED UP OPFIND
                 36: *                                          ADDED CHANEL AND ERROR TO CONTEXT BLOCK
                 37: *                                          INSTALLED OPLESCALAR, OPSESCALAR
                 38: *                  4/4/82 1.4i             I.B. EDIT FOR TEST ON 6809.
                 39: *                          A. CHANGED SUBSTRING ASSIGNMENT TO BLANK PAD IF SOURCE STRING
                 40: *                          WAS SHORTER THAN DESTINATION SUBSTRING.
                 41: *                          B. FATAL ERRORS PRINT ADDRESS OF ORIGINAL SIN.
                 42: *                          C. FIXED SO ^B IN INPUT DIDN'T DESTROY INPUT LINE
                 43: *                  7/29/82 1.4j            I.B. Clean up patches for re-assembly
                 44: *                  11/8/82 1.4k            I.B. Install BLOCKMOVEUP; fast backward shuffle on 6800
                 45: *                  1/16/85 1.4l            I.B. MODIFY TO OPERATE ON 6801 (REMOVE REFS TO $0-$1F)
                 46: *                                          ADDED "BVAL" AND "BVAL$" OPCODES
                 47: *                                          SPEEDED UP EOFBGEN2 BY DOING TABLE LOOKUP TO GEN MASK
                 48: *                                          SPEEDED UP "SUBFUNENTRY" AND "XOPSUBRET" BY PUSHING
                 49: *                                               CONTEXT BLOCK MORE EFFICIENTLY
                 50: *                                          SPEEDED UP "OPFOR" OPCODE AND BLOCK MOVES (6809 ONLY)




