                 64: *                  ACMP -- ARITHMETIC COMPARE SUBROUTINE
                 65: *                  COMPARE TOS-1 WITH TOS
                 66: *                  SET SIGN IF TOS-1 VALUE < TOS VALUE
                 67: *                  SET "Z" IF TOS-1 VALUE = TOS VALUE
                 68: *                  RESET "OVERFLOW" BIT
                 69: *
  0780           70: ACMPF              ;PULD                   SAVE RETURN ADDRESS
0780 32          71:                    PULA
