                157: *                  STR1 IS COMPARED TO STR2
                158: *                  STATUS OF COMPARE IS RETURNED IN STATUS REG
                159: *                  STRINGS EQUAL IFF STRING LENGTHS ARE = AND STRING HEADS ARE =
                160: *                  LESS THAN IF (HEADS SAME & SL1 < SL2) OR HEAD1 < HEAD2
                161: *                  GT IF (HEADS SAME & SL1 > SL2) OR HEAD1 > HEAD2
                162: *
  0001          163:                    IF      M6800!M6801
07C0 30         164: SCMPLS             TSX                     LIKE ACMP WANTS; DON'T TOUCH CC!
