0F62 D623        53:                    LDAB    FROMPOINTER+1
0F64 D027        54:                    SUBB    LIMIT+1         (B):= COUNT MOD 256
0F66 C50F        55:                    BITB    #%00001111      ....?
0F68 2734        56:                    BEQ     BLOCKMOVEDOWNB  B/ YEP.
                 57: *
                 58: *                  MOVE 4 BYTES AT A TIME UNTIL A MULTIPLE OF 16 IS LEFT TO MOVE
                 59: *                  COPY RATE IS 23.5 uS. PER BYTE
