13EC 271D       163:                    BEQ     SUBFUN2         B/ NOPE
                164:                    ;LDX    RTP:LASTPARAMADDR,X GET POINTER TO LAST ARGUMENT VARIABLE
13EE EE03       165:                    LDX     RTP:LASTPARAMADDR,X
  0001          166:                    IF      M6800
  13F0          167: SUBFUNL            EQU     *               PARAMETER FILL LOOP
13F0 33         168:                    PULB                    COPY ARGUMENT VALUE INTO A PARAMETER VARIABLE
                169:                    ;STB    ,X
