  16E2          230: NEXTIOV            ;PSHD                   RATS, LOOP INDEX > 65535: CONVERT TO 4 BYTE INTEGER
16E2 37         231:                    PSHB
16E3 36         232:                    PSHA
                233:                    ;LDD    #1              EQUIVALENT OF CORRECT SUM
