24C5 EB00       350:                    ADDB    ,X              ASSERT: SUM <= 299!
24C7 2B0F       351:                    BMI     FCROSBB         B/ 255>=SUM>=128
24C9 251B       352:                    BCS     FCROSBC         B/ 256<=SUM<=299
                353:                    ;CMPB   #100            IS SUM >= 100 ?
24CB C164       354:                    CMPB    #100
24CD 2503       355:                    BCS     FCROSP1A        B/ NO, GET OUT!
