 *S*            391: *                  EITHER THIS CONDITIONAL IF IS ON, OR THE ONE FOLLOWING MULBASE 100 IS ON
 *S*            392: MULDIV100          EQU     *               CONVERTS MSB OF PRODUCT TO APPROX PRODUCT/100
 *S*            393:                    RPT     9999//256
