260A C47F       572:                    ANDB    #$7F
260C 10         573:                    SBA
260D 4C         574:                    INCA                    ASSUME FIRST QUO DIG <> 0
                575:                    ;STA    MEXP
260E 97AF       576:                    STAA    MEXP
                577: *
                578:                    ;CLR    FAC1            U0 IN "KNUTH"IAN NOTATION
2610 7F00B0     579:                    CLR     FAC1




ASM/6800 1.4A0: 2610 RTP6800V1.4l       SD BASIC Version 1.4l Runtime Package (c) 1980 Software Dynamics
08/16/82 00:00:00; Page 307; Form 13    *** F L O A T I N G   P O I N T ***
