                  2: *                  FLOATING INPUT CONVERSION ROUTINES
                  3: *                  A,B CONTAIN MAX # OF CHARS TO EAT (INCLUDING BLANKS)
                  4: *                  X REG CONTAINS POINTER TO CHARACTER STRING TO CONVERT
                  5: *                  RESULT IS CONVERTED TO FLOATING POINT FORMAT AND PUSHED ONTO THE STACK
                  6: *                  X REG WILL POINT PAST STRING WHEN DONE
                  7: *                  DOES NOT EAT THE CR OR ANY OTHER DELIMITER
                  8: *                  WHOLE STRING IS EATEN EVEN IF ERROR OCCURED
                  9: *                  ROUTINE WILL EAT STRINGS OF THE FOLLOWING FORMAT:
                 10: *                  <0 OR MORE BLANKS> FOLLOWED BY
                 11: *                  <'+' OR '-' OR NOTHING> FOLLOWED BY
                 12: *                  <1 OR MORE DIGITS WHICH MAY CONTAIN A '.' ANYWHERE IN THIS FIELD
                 13: *                  FIELD MAY CONTAIN UP TO 10 SIGNIFICANT DIGITS
                 14: *                  (LEADING ZEROES ARE NOT CONSIDERED SIGNIFICANT
                 15: *                  EXAMPLE:
                 16: *                  0.000000103456789
                 17: *                  THE "0.000000" PART IS NOT CONSIDERED SIGNIFICANT,
                 18: *                  WHILE THE "103456789" PART IS CONSIDERED SIGNIFICANT)
                 19: *                  MAY NOT BE > 127 NON-SIG ZEROS RIGHT OF DP & PRECEEDING SIG DIGITS
                 20: *                  EXCESS SIGNIFICANT DIGITS ARE READ AND IGNORED> FOLLOWED BY
                 21: *                  <'e', 'E' OR NOT A 'E'> (DONE IF NOT 'E', ELSE...) FOLLOWED BY
                 22: *                  <'+' OR '-' OR NOTHING> FOLLOWED BY
                 23: *                  <UP TO 3 DIGITS NOT TO EXCEED 126> FOLLOWED BY
                 24: *                  <NOT A DIGIT>
                 25: *
                 26: *                  JSR     FCONVI
                 27: *                  BRA     ALL OK
                 28: *                  BRA     OVERFLOW
                 29: *                  BRA     SYNTAX ERROR
                 30: *
29B5 8D62        31: FCONVI31           BSR     GETCHAR
29B7 8D46        32: LEFTDIG            BSR     ISDIG
29B9 200D        33:                    BRA     FCONVI32
                 34:                    ;CMPA   #'.
29BB 812E        35:                    CMPA    #'.
29BD 261F        36:                    BNE     FCONVI33
                 37:                    ;LDA    DPFLAG
29BF 96D1        38:                    LDAA    DPFLAG
29C1 261B        39:                    BNE     FCONVI33
29C3 4C          40:                    INCA
                 41:                    ;STA    DPFLAG
29C4 97D1        42:                    STAA    DPFLAG
29C6 20ED        43:                    BRA     FCONVI31
  29C8           44: FCONVI32           ;TFR    A,B             MULTIPLY LEFT DIGIT OF PAIR BY 10
29C8 16          45:                    TAB
29C9 48          46:                    ASLA
29CA 48          47:                    ASLA
29CB 1B          48:                    ABA
29CC 48          49:                    ASLA
                 50:                    ;STA    ,X
29CD A700        51:                    STAA    0,X
  29CF           52: FCONVI36           ;LDA    DPFLAG
29CF 96D1        53:                    LDAA    DPFLAG
29D1 260A        54:                    BNE     FCONVI37
                 55:                    ;INC    DPCOUNT
29D3 7C00D2      56:                    INC     DPCOUNT




