                 94: *                  FIX FLOATING POINT NUMBER
                 95: *                  6 BYTE NUMBER ON TOS IS CONVERTED TO
                 96: *                  4 BYTE SIGNED 2'S COMPLEMENT INTEGER
                 97: *                  SKIP RETURN IF CAN'T FIX (# < - 2^31 OR # > 2^31 - 1)
                 98: *                  IF # < 1, RETURN ZERO
                 99: *
2BEB 30         100: FIX                TSX
                101:                    ;LDA    2,X             GET EXPONENT
2BEC A602       102:                    LDAA    2,X
                103:                    ;TFR    A,B
2BEE 16         104:                    TAB
